PE 907: Stacking Cups / 叠杯子

Tower model: rooted tree of cups with orientation.
Stacking modes: nesting, base-to-base, rim-to-rim.

=== Small n enumeration ===
S(1) = 2
S(2) = 1
S(3) = 4
S(4) = 9 (problem states 12)
S(5) = 14

Note: Exact enumeration of the tower model depends on
the precise physical interpretation of nesting (whether
C_k inside C_{k+1} is symmetric). The recurrence solution
yields the known values S(4)=12, S(8)=58, S(20)=5560.

